OL,3,GNEWSADouglas resident taken to hospital
OL,4,Aafter fire in flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Douglas resident has been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after a flat fire in Anagh
OL,8,FCoar.
OL,10,FFirefighters found the occupant of the
OL,11,Ffirst-floor flat at the front door and
OL,12,Fhelped them to safety, with heavy smoke
OL,13,Fand flames coming from several windows.
OL,15,FThey were treated by paramedics for
OL,16,Fsmoke inhalation before being taken to
OL,17,FNoble's Hospital for further checks.
OL,19,FAn investigation is under way to find
OL,20,Fthe cause of the fire, which was first
OL,21,Freported at about 20:30 GMT on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
